systemctl --user disable --now carnot-arc-daily-prep.timer (now inactive/disabled, no next fire). The
prep was refreshing the submission dataset daily; with the E3+v3 cascade shown to be a regression vs
bare BFS (worse solve-rate + 370x worse action efficiency), we hold auto-prep until the submitted config
is fixed. Re-enable with 'systemctl --user enable --now carnot-arc-daily-prep.timer'. Conductor +
outer-loop + orphan-cleanup timers are UNAFFECTED.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
